eduled</span>\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-meta\">send time set</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"diagram-node\" data-node=\"sending\" style=\"--col: 5; --row: 2\">\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-name\">Sending</span>\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-meta\">provider active</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"diagram-node\" data-node=\"retry\" data-tone=\"warn\" style=\"--col: 5; --row: 1\">\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-eyebrow\">Recovery</span>\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-name\">Delivery retry</span>\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-meta\">attempt 1 of 3</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"diagram-node\" data-node=\"sent\" data-tone=\"accent\" style=\"--col: 6; --row: 2\">\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-name\">Sent</span>\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-meta\">delivered</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"diagram-node\" data-node=\"cancel\" data-tone=\"muted\" style=\"--col: 4; --row: 3\">\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-eyebrow\">Terminal</span>\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-name\">Cancelled</span>\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-meta\">stopped by owner</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"diagram-node\" data-node=\"failed\" data-tone=\"danger\" style=\"--col: 6; --row: 3\">\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-eyebrow\">Terminal</span>\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-name\">Failed</span>\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-meta\">retries exhausted</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <ol class=\"diagram-edges\">\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"draft\" data-to=\"edit\">write</li>\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"edit\" data-to=\"approval:bottom\">submit</li>\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"approval:right\" data-to=\"sched:top\">approve</li>\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"sched\" data-to=\"sending\">start</li>\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"sending\" data-to=\"sent\" data-tone=\"accent\"></li>\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"sending:top\" data-to=\"retry:bottom\" data-line=\"dashed\">error</li>\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"retry:right\" data-to=\"sent:top\" data-line=\"dashed\">retry</li>\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"sched:bottom\" data-to=\"cancel:top\" data-line=\"dashed\">cancel</li>\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"retry\" data-to=\"failed\" data-line=\"dashed\" data-tone=\"danger\">exhausted</li>\n  </ol>\n</figure>\n","individual":true},{"label":"Newsletter lifecycle, step by step","html":"<figure\n  class=\"diagram\"\n  id=\"dg-life-steps\"\n  data-type=\"state-lifecycle\"\n  data-steps\n  data-autoplay\n  aria-label=\"Newsletter publication lifecycle\"\n>\n  <figcaption class=\"diagram-caption\">\n    <span class=\"diagram-eyebrow\">Lifecycle phase map</span>\n    <span class=\"diagram-title\">A newsletter, from draft to sent</span>\n    <span class=\"diagram-dek\">Primary phases on the rail; waits and recovery above, terminal outcomes below.</span>\n  </figcaption>\n  <div\n    class=\"diagram-canvas\"\n    style=\"--cols: 6; grid-template-columns: 4.5rem repeat(5, minmax(6.5rem, 1fr)); --diagram-node-w: 7.5rem\"\n  >\n    <div class=\"diagram-group\" data-shape=\"lane\" data-step=\"0\" style=\"--col: 1; --row: 1; --span: 6\"\n      ><span class=\"diagram-group-label\">Wait / recovery</span></div\n    >\n    <div class=\"diagram-group\" data-shape=\"lane\" data-step=\"0\" style=\"--col: 1; --row: 2; --span: 6\"\n      ><span class=\"diagram-group-label\">Primary phases</span></div\n    >\n    <div class=\"diagram-group\" data-shape=\"lane\" data-step=\"0\" style=\"--col: 1; --row: 3; --span: 6\"\n      ><span class=\"diagram-group-label\">Terminal outcomes</span></div\n    >\n    <div class=\"diagram-node\" data-node=\"draft\" data-step=\"1\" style=\"--col: 2; --row: 2\">\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-name\">Draft</span>\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-meta\">content exists</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"diagram-node\" data-node=\"edit\" data-step=\"2\" style=\"-