"diagram-node-name\">Failed</span>\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-meta\">retries exhausted</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <ol class=\"diagram-edges\">\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"draft\" data-to=\"edit\">write</li>\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"edit\" data-to=\"approval:bottom\">submit</li>\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"approval:right\" data-to=\"sched:top\">approve</li>\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"sched\" data-to=\"sending\">start</li>\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"sending\" data-to=\"sent\" data-tone=\"accent\"></li>\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"sending:top\" data-to=\"retry:bottom\" data-line=\"dashed\">error</li>\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"retry:right\" data-to=\"sent:top\" data-line=\"dashed\">retry</li>\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"sched:bottom\" data-to=\"cancel:top\" data-line=\"dashed\">cancel</li>\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"retry\" data-to=\"failed\" data-line=\"dashed\" data-tone=\"danger\">exhausted</li>\n  </ol>\n</figure>\n","individual":true},{"label":"Legal review added","html":"<figure\n  class=\"diagram\"\n  id=\"dg-life-delta\"\n  data-type=\"state-lifecycle\"\n  data-delta\n  aria-label=\"Lifecycle with legal review\"\n>\n  <figcaption class=\"diagram-caption\">\n    <span class=\"diagram-eyebrow\">Policy change</span>\n    <span class=\"diagram-title\">Legal review before scheduling</span>\n  </figcaption>\n  <div class=\"diagram-canvas\" style=\"--cols: 4\">\n    <div class=\"diagram-group\" data-shape=\"lane\" style=\"--col: 1; --row: 1; --span: 4\"\n      ><span class=\"diagram-group-label\">Wait</span></div\n    >\n    <div class=\"diagram-group\" data-shape=\"lane\" style=\"--col: 1; --row: 2; --span: 4\"\n      ><span class=\"diagram-group-label\">Primary</span></div\n    >\n    <div class=\"diagram-node\" data-node=\"edit\" style=\"--col: 2; --row: 2\"\n      ><span class=\"diagram-node-name\">Editi